      "body": "AJC roadmap and blueprint overstate closure\n\n**The dashboard currently reports critical cones as done/Lean-complete while their mapped declarations remain open.** `AJC.fbc` is `done` despite the three sorries at `CechHigherDirectImageUnconditional.lean:197,1690,1758`; `AJC.grquot` is `done` while `QuotRepresentability.lean:79` remains open; and `Jacobian.tex` marks the statement and proof of `def:picardJacobianWitness` `\\leanok` although `Jacobian.lean:188` is `sorry`. Downstream proof markers such as `thm:nonempty_jacobianWitness` and `thm:pic0_isAbelianVariety` also ignore sorry-bearing dependencies.\n\nRefactor the nine flat `AJC.*` items under `AJC.jacobian`, split FBC/Quot/Pic0/Albanese into honest leaf subitems, and remove proof-level `\\leanok` until each dependency cone is closed. Keep the mathematical gap details in existing items `I-0083` and `I-0118`.",
